{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56345","headline":"咏千僧釜 · 高瀛","name":"咏千僧釜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香积厨空铁釜存，万年鼎列镇山门。\n何时再作千僧供，饭罢潮音彻远村。\n（见同治十一年刊黄凤楼纂《德化县志》卷四九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高瀛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}